Type " R"
Sleep 800ms
Ctrl+W
Type "l"
Type "l"
Sleep 300ms
Type "j"
Type "l"
Sleep 500ms
Type "jjjjjjjjjjjjjjj"
Type "l"
Sleep 500ms
Escape
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 300ms
Screenshot "overview.png"
Sleep 300ms
